--- !u!114 &1527839236
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1527839234}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ba7f8c21df8f2748b007509b09ab81e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subjectText: {fileID: 1527839237}
  descText: {fileID: 355211004}
  subjects:
  - Wind Fortress
  - Scorch Station
  - Mrs C
  - Matrioshka Space
  - The Bloodways
  - Tartarus
  - SENTINEL
  - ZELUS
  - C>_ENTINEL
  - Utterances
  descriptions:
  - Skirting the heels of the [Cassiel Division] are its watchful eyes and eager
    hands. Defunct armies lay dormant, their memory flitting across the savage wind,
    carried in the turbulent air of the dark sky.
  - Within the bowels of the [Cassiel Division] are innumerable beating hearts, designed
    to process crude blood into a more divine fuel, aided by the arcane power of
    [Mrs.C]. The flames of Scorch Station X bellow out the vengeance of those devoured.
  - There were at one time rumors of a hidden god under the [Cassiel Division], drawing
    in life from millions of miles away. These rumors left as the Saturnians did,
    but a piece of this god is still carried in the hearts of all men, and all of
    their children forever.
  - '"Clones were always a special concoction. Its unknown what truly goes on in
    its mind, or how such a minute creature could result in something so powerful..."'
  - For bulk production of Prometheum, vast pipeways were required. Now that the
    city is empty, such things have rotted and been left to stagnation. What's left
    isn't pretty.
  - What happened? Why am I here? I can't be here. She is there. There is malice
    here. I can't be here. I can't be here.
  - 'Sentinels were special operatives that tended to the city.                      
    The Mother Computer did not control them, but they were slaves to a different
    influence: Loyalty.'
  - Once a drone created by Mrs C, mutated and transformed by Prometheum into a energy
    parasite. It has no mind; It seeks only to destroy.
  - Once a Sentinel, now a puppet of a much more malevolent force. Strike them down!
  - 'YE TREMBLING AND SNIVELING THINGS; ALL HAVE COMPLETED UTTER CRIME. EXTINGUISH,
    AND RETURN TO ME. '
  debugText: 0
  bossAggro: 0
